# 🔐 Auth Service

A production-inspired authentication and authorization service built with **Node.js, Express, TypeScript, Prisma, and PostgreSQL**.

Designed as an independent Identity Service for a future **microservices architecture**, supporting secure authentication, device sessions, email verification, password reset, refresh token rotation, and RS256 JWT authentication.

---

## ✨ Features

### Authentication

- User Registration
- User Login
- User Logout
- Access Token (RS256)
- Refresh Token (HS256)
- Refresh Token Rotation

### Authorization

- Role Based Access Control (RBAC)
- Protected Routes
- JWT Authentication Middleware

### Email

- Email Verification
- Verification Email Resend
- Forgot Password
- Password Reset

### Session Management

- Device Sessions
- View Active Sessions
- Logout Current Session
- Logout All Sessions

### Security

- Password Hashing (bcrypt)
- Refresh Token Hashing
- Secure Verification Tokens
- Secure Password Reset Tokens
- HttpOnly Refresh Cookies
- Helmet
- CORS
- Rate Limiting
- Environment Validation
- Global Error Handling

---

